    {
      "number": 799,
      "text": "And there were messengers before you [O Prophet] who were ridiculed, but those who mocked them were overwhelmed by what they used to ridicule.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
