      "page": 129,
      "ruku": 103,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 803,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “Should I take any guardian other than Allah, the Originator of the heavens and earth, Who feeds but is not fed?” Say, “I have been commanded to be the first to submit [to Allah] and not to be one of those who associate partners with Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 129,
      "ruku": 103,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 804,
      "text": "Say, “If I disobey my Lord, I fear the punishment of a momentous Day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 129,
      "ruku": 103,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 805,
      "text": "Whoever is spared the punishment on that Day is blessed with His mercy. That is the clear triumph.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 129,
      "ruku": 103,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 806,
      "text": "If Allah afflicts you with harm, there is none to remove it except Him; if He grants you good, He is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
